+This section covers the scheduling of densification operations (splitting, cloning, pruning) over the course of training. It details how gradient thresholds are adjusted dynamically to control Gaussian count, preventing explosion in complex regions while ensuring sufficient detail in textured areas. It also covers the timing of these operations relative to the total iteration budget.
