+This section addresses the scaling of 3DGS training to large scenes that exceed single-GPU memory. It covers strategies for sharding the Gaussian list across multiple GPUs, managing communication overhead for gradient aggregation, and implementing out-of-core techniques for scenes that do not fit in VRAM.
